{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Groundskeeper is 2D top down indie horror featuring a retro pixel style for a delightful and retro spooky vibe. Step into Gramen Park, conduct your nightly rounds and keep an eye on things from the warmth of your security hut. But do beware, there's something sinister lurking inside...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Groundskeeper you take on the nightshift with a job to keep Gramen Park in shape and protected. Armed with a task list and a tool shed you'll be quickly interrupted by pesky teenagers who will make your life more difficult and a faulty generator that plunges you into darkness. A darkness that may reveal a more sinister force at work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this full version you will now be able to explore Gramen Manor. A forgotten relic of the Gramen park estate and home to the mysterious monster that roams the grounds. Can you figure out where this monster came from? Or is making it out alive more important...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D horror-adventure featuring exploration and action elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressions of violence and pixelated gore</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593360?t=1759933761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593360/b87e179be603eccf468d2e047a7631c0a8ee8d59/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759933761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593360/3a0acc4b5f7f71522967ceadeff1aaf446c0966f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759933761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593360/3a0acc4b5f7f71522967ceadeff1aaf446c0966f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759933761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Groundskeeper is 2D top down indie horror featuring a retro pixel style for a delightful and retro spooky vibe. Step into Gramen Park, conduct your nightly rounds and keep an eye on things from the warmth of your security hut. But do beware, there's something sinister lurking inside...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Groundskeeper you take on the nightshift with a job to keep Gramen Park in shape and protected. Armed with a task list and a tool shed you'll be quickly interrupted by pesky teenagers who will make your life more difficult and a faulty generator that plunges you into darkness. A darkness that may reveal a more sinister force at work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this full version you will now be able to explore Gramen Manor. A forgotten relic of the Gramen park estate and home to the mysterious monster that roams the grounds. Can you figure out where this monster came from? Or is making it out alive more important...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D horror-adventure featuring exploration and action elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressions of violence and pixelated gore</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fermented Oddity Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593360/ee01c87568643e10b52976b989924ab122d67407/header.jpg?t=1759933761","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3593360/387833462/ec8687317d3e7d33dbba3773e4b7ec77f09a1a15/1755968044/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755970760","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.